    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that \"quiet\" you're talking about... it just feels hollow. like i'm just waiting for the clock to run out. if you know you'll never reach the peak, what's the point of even climbing? it feels like living a half-life. why bother with the routine and the effort if the ceiling is already so low?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
